<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/003bbfa1bf036f8b9ad848eb1de62231854080514b58ca0831b944cb860727ac> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
