<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/03987447a92583b5256032a44ad54f5ea5b9d69ea4fe1fd4f31d9f9781ce04de> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
