<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/13f7ac6ee95c6b46f7b9a3ea49950216125422c519cea3a5cbb83b211cca58c6> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
