<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/21275949b38f9dc15a60294e5aae46f82ec27ec898a7e42d7eaf7ce1f0df13af> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
