<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/21c6f1b8097bb971d6fb8e88cf4627d2e94f3ccc1ad21820588fdb24663ade57> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
