<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/22e08f7a9c1810c8cc18dbd9fbd9856b9ec3a8ce13acc3a4d446905f17d8ebb5> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
