<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/23621d69c4ff57dce5c6db4b7818dc3e467b25125a38ea435e8c6d2c8ced345d> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
