<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/2389ef770b46b991b0b2937b1b0cca67e2e68dedfaec52ea78a4fa8e3597aaef> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
