<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/57d86e5ba64e6d2badc832dd3d32047c7c741b98125eca20774d0921f1125593> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
