<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/5845df4edceb564f3f555d13240bd71144ffb314763655e3c98736c1a9ceb2c7> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
