<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/6e8a31d26f1d8b7d6c683fe65e948f1136e87fa8ae03dd19844905e735b30716> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
