<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/86583e4ab291acaad9b64ea93076413bbffdddbe6e2fb3e5ea4d48400baaab10> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
