<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/8669c196d2c59cd3438224f214bf4e5e47e6021a4bde8aca275460b09da5d7bf> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
