<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/d0ac7748965e4fe5926ffacd4402fae3bc8e0d20af92d949b1df537199997928> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
