<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/d39ade6c524d486f97a2e4c780f0c037bd5253a58ad3c8bb6ef5abc203bcdef0> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
