<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/e45ffa293f492ff0519502ae103aca642be709e7656abd21c7fedb1142fb46fd> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
