<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/e4bbacacdfcf122c2a4bba27e9282f8c77eee48f4a8dc002e823bc9da4d91367> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
