<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/f14dddbbd0416e0800c7c71cb2b2fe32dd7c07021566fad6d5222b97aaba382b> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#conductScheme> ;
