<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/f4d400788ece073587cb035e62d58ccd58e2d165dfeca99e175ad80d1fbda7ff> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
