<https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/data/concept/conduct/f53b9dd1721b734e69c60ec991a2383c86236521a832e377bd9328014de4c323> a <https://w3id.org/legal-ontology-rag/ontology/occurrence-context#RegulatedConduct> ;
